[https://rafapm.com Rafael Perez Martinez], [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=fA5lbHUAAAAJ&hl=en Masaya Iwamoto], [https://www.annabanzer.com/ Ana B. Morgado], [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=Ne4a3DMAAAAJ&hl=en Yiao Li], [https://www.linkedin.com/in/roberto-tinti-08699210/ Roberto Tinti], [https://www.linkedin.com/in/jianjun-xu-5a8682154 Jianjun Xu], Chad Gillease, Steven Cochran, [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=igQgYrMAAAAJ&hl=en Bhawani Shankar], [https://www.linkedin.com/in/else-marie-schmidt-445a196 Else-Marie Schmidt], [https://www.linkedin.com/in/zijiansong Zijian Song], [https://www.linkedin.com/in/natalie-wagner-95048a24 Natalie Wagner], [https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=x_eWmzgAAAAJ&hl=en Philipp Pahl], [https://www.linkedin.com/in/alexander-petr-41026b37/en Alexander Petr], and [https://profiles.stanford.edu/srabanti-chowdhury Srabanti Chowdhury]

